<title>USA: Hubbell ups quarterly div to $0.29 shr.</title>
<headline>Hubbell ups quarterly div to $0.29 shr.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Conn. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount			$0.29			   $0.26</p>
<p> Pay			    Jul 11</p>
<p> Record			 Jun 23</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Hubbell Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it will set a new annual dividend of $1.16 per share from $1.04 per share starting this quarter, an 11.5 percent increase.</p>
